# The Mercenary token's "{T}: Target creature you control gets +1/+0 until end of turn. Activate only as a sorcery." Bot1 made it
# on turn three (Lassoed by the Law exiled Bot2's Ornithopter). On turn five it is no longer summoning sick: the ability is
# refused during the upkeep (sorcery speed), refuses Bot2's creature as a target, and accepts Bot1's Ornithopter (and the
# Mercenary itself, tapped as the cost). The bonus is power only and is gone by the next turn.

